    name: Jenva
    sentences:
    - Hello Young adventurer !
    - You are probably wondering how to overcome this obstacle.
    - You just have to jump to catch the zipline.
    - I wish you good luck in your quest young adventurer.
  isThereASecondDialogue: 1
  secondDialogue:
    name: Jenva
    sentences:
    - Hello Young adventurer ! Oh ! It's you again !
    - If you don't remember what I said, I can repeat myself.
    - You just have to jump to catch the zipline.
    - I wish you good luck in your quest young adventurer.
  isThereASpecialDialogue: 0
  specialDialogue:
    name: 
